{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sector Unknown is a story-rich, isometric sci-fi RPG set in a shadowy expanse of space. Begin on a desolate planet, establish a stronghold, explore space, ally with or dominate local factions, and combat a despotic organization set on ruthlessly exploiting the sector's resources and inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The soundtrack for <i>Sector Unknown</i> is composed by Daryl Bennett, also known for his work on <i>Deadwater Saloon</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daryl Bennett is based in Vancouver British Columbia and has been composing award winning scores for film and television for over 30 years.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593880?t=1742261673","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593880?t=1742261673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593880/8c6f1c0470f5cdf050ac1271780d707c4709afe8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742261673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593880/8c6f1c0470f5cdf050ac1271780d707c4709afe8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742261673","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sector Unknown is a story-rich, isometric sci-fi RPG set in a shadowy expanse of space. Begin on a desolate planet, establish a stronghold, explore space, ally with or dominate local factions, and combat a despotic organization set on ruthlessly exploiting the sector's resources and inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The soundtrack for <i>Sector Unknown</i> is composed by Daryl Bennett, also known for his work on <i>Deadwater Saloon</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daryl Bennett is based in Vancouver British Columbia and has been composing award winning scores for film and television for over 30 years.</p>","developers":["Creative Storm Entertainment"],"fullgame":{"appid":"